<title>USA: TWA to announce marketing alliance.</title>
<headline>TWA to announce marketing alliance.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trans World Airlines Inc said on Tuesday that it will hold a news conference on October 9 to announce what it termed a major new national marketing alliance with a real estate firm.</p>
<p>The news conference will be held at the company's corporate headquarters here at 1330 CDT/1830 GMT.</p>
<p>TWA president and chief executive officer Jeffrey Erickson and executives from the real estate firm will review and discuss the alliance.</p>
<p>A TWA spokesman declined to provide further details.</p>
<p>TWA shares were trading off 1/4 to 8-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
